    <span>I have read and accept the <strong>Care &amp; Handling Terms</strong>.</span>
  </label>
  <details class="checkout-terms__details">
    <summary>Read the care terms</summary>
    <p>Our handmade T-shirts are dry clean only. THELIVINGSTOP is not responsible for damage, shrinkage, colour change, distortion, or any other loss caused by incorrect washing, drying, ironing, dry-cleaning, or other care.</p>
  </details>
  <p class="checkout-terms__error" data-checkout-terms-error role="alert" hidden>Please accept the Care &amp; Handling Terms before checkout.</p>
</div>
